---
import { Box } from "@lucide/astro";
import Image from "astro/components/Image.astro";
---

<>
<section class="w-full flex-center mx-auto px-4 overflow-hidden">
    <div class="w-full col-center gap-14 max-w-6xl mt-14 md:mt-16 lg:mt-20">
        <div class="col-center gap-0.5">
            <span class="flex-center gap-2 px-3.5 py-0.5 bg-white border border-[#e4e4e4] rounded-full fade-in-up">
                <div class="w-3.5 md:w-4 4xl:w-5">
                    <Box stroke-width={2} class="w-full text-gray-800" />
                </div>
                <h4 class="text-[11px] md:text-[13px] 4xl:text-[15px] font-medium  text-gray-800">
                    Importance
                </h4>
            </span>
            <h2 class="h2-bold text-center mt-3 lg:mt-4 2xl:mt-5 fade-in-up">
                Why Land Acquisition Matters
            </h2>
            <p class="text-sm lg:text-base 2xl:text-lg leading-snug text-gray-500 max-w-3xl text-justify md:text-center px-auto mt-3 lg:mt-4 2xl:mt-5 fade-in-up">
                <span class="inline-block">Land acquisition is the foundation of successful warehouse development</span><span class="inline-block"> impacting location strategy, scalability, legal compliance, and operational efficiency.</span>
            </p>
        </div>
        <div class="w-full col-center gap-4 md:gap-5">
            <div class="w-full flex-stretch gap-4 md:gap-5">
                <div class="w-full md:w-3/5 py-4 md:py-5 lg:py-6 px-5 md:px-6 lg:px-8 xl:px-9 flex flex-col items-start justify-between bg-white border border-[#dcdcdc] rounded-xl fade-in-up">
                    <div class="w-full flex justify-end pb-7">
                        <div class="w-14 md:w-20 lg:w-24 p-2 aspect-square rounded-l-full rounded-br-full bg-(--secondary-color)">
                            <div class="w-full h-full rounded-l-full rounded-br-full bg-(--primary-color) flex-center">
                                <Image src="/icons/land-acq-icon-1.webp" alt="land-acq-icon-1" width={60} height={60} class="w-[55%]" />
                            </div>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                    <div class="flex flex-col items-start">
                        <h3 class="h3-md pb-2.5 md:pb-3 lg:pb-4">Strategic Location</h3>
                        <p class="text-base lg:text-lg leading-snug text-gray-500">
                            Proximity to major highways, ports, demographics centres, power, water, and transportation hubs reduces logistic costs and lead time.
                        </p>
                    </div>
                </div>
                <div class="w-full md:w-2/5 py-4 md:py-5 lg:py-6 px-5 md:px-6 lg:px-8 xl:px-9 flex flex-col items-start justify-between bg-white border border-[#dcdcdc] rounded-xl fade-in-up">
                    <div class="w-full flex justify-end pb-7">
                        <div class="w-14 md:w-20 lg:w-24 p-2 aspect-square rounded-l-full rounded-br-full bg-(--secondary-color)">
                            <div class="w-full h-full rounded-l-full rounded-br-full bg-(--primary-color) flex-center">
                                <Image src="/icons/land-acq-icon-3.webp" alt="land-acq-icon-3" width={60} height={60} class="w-[55%]" />
                            </div>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                    <div class="flex flex-col items-start">
                        <h3 class="h3-md pb-2.5 md:pb-3 lg:pb-4">Scalability & Future-Proofing</h3>
                        <p class="lg:text-lg leading-snug text-gray-500">
                            Land parcels should permit expansion, utility availability, and infrastructure growth.
                        </p>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
            <div class="w-full flex-stretch gap-4 md:gap-5">
                <div class="w-full md:w-2/5 py-4 md:py-5 lg:py-6 px-5 md:px-6 lg:px-8 xl:px-9 flex flex-col items-start justify-between bg-white border border-[#dcdcdc] rounded-xl fade-in-up">
                    <div class="w-full flex justify-end pb-7">
                        <div class="w-14 md:w-20 lg:w-24 p-2 aspect-square rounded-l-full rounded-br-full bg-(--secondary-color)">
                            <div class="w-full h-full rounded-l-full rounded-br-full bg-(--primary-color) flex-center">
                                <Image src="/icons/land-acq-icon-4.webp" alt="land-acq-icon-4" width={60} height={60} class="w-[55%]" />
                            </div>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                    <div class="flex flex-col items-start">
                        <h3 class="h3-md pb-2.5 md:pb-3 lg:pb-4">Risk Mitigation</h3>
                        <p class="lg:text-lg leading-snug text-gray-500">
                            Thorough due diligence (title, legal, environmental, etc.) helps avoid bureaucratic delays & legal hurdles.
                        </p>
                    </div>
                </div>
                <div class="w-full md:w-3/5 py-4 md:py-5 lg:py-6 px-5 md:px-6 lg:px-8 xl:px-9 flex flex-col items-start justify-between bg-white border border-[#dcdcdc] rounded-xl fade-in-up">
                    <div class="w-full flex justify-end pb-7">
                        <div class="w-14 md:w-20 lg:w-24 p-2 aspect-square rounded-l-full rounded-br-full bg-(--secondary-color)">
                            <div class="w-full h-full rounded-l-full rounded-br-full bg-(--primary-color) flex-center">
                                <Image src="/icons/land-acq-icon-2.webp" alt="land-acq-icon-2" width={60} height={60} class="w-[55%]" />
                            </div>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                    <div class="flex flex-col items-start">
                        <h3 class="h3-md pb-2.5 md:pb-3 lg:pb-4">Regulatory Complexity</h3>
                        <p class="lg:text-lg leading-snug text-gray-500">
                            India’s land laws, zoning norms, environment & forest clearances, local authority statutes require careful navigation.
                        </p>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
</section>
</>

